// rule-evidence: docs/design/vips/0027-declaration-output.md#15fca8692bd36be1
// VIP-27 written schema types: one written, nongeneric `type X = typeof X.Type` in the same scope replaces the synthesized alias, for either ordinary `schema X` form and in either source order.
// Message is the struct form written type-last, Early the alias form written type-first; schema-written-type-collisions and schema-written-type-scopes hold the controls.
